# 低频词汇 List04
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List04核心词汇

{{bond}}{/bɒnd/}{纽带；债券}{The shared experience created a strong bond between them.}}
{{bonus}}{/ˈbəʊnəs/}{奖金；红利}{Employees received a year-end bonus for their hard work.}}
{{booklet}}{/ˈbʊklɪt/}{小册子}{The tourist information center distributes free booklets.}}
{{boom}}{/buːm/}{繁荣；激增}{The housing boom led to rising property prices.}}
{{boost}}{/buːst/}{促进；推动}{The new marketing strategy boosted sales by 25%.}}
{{bore}}{/bɔːr/}{使厌烦；钻孔}{The long lecture bored the students to sleep.}}
{{botanical}}{/bəˈtænɪkl/}{植物学的}{The botanical garden houses over 10,000 plant species.}}
{{bounce}}{/baʊns/}{弹跳；反弹}{The ball bounced off the wall and rolled across the floor.}}
{{boycott}}{/ˈbɔɪkɒt/}{抵制；联合抵制}{Consumers organized a boycott of the brand.}}
{{brace}}{/breɪs/}{支架；支撑}{She braced herself for the challenging interview.}}
{{brake}}{/breɪk/}{刹车；制动器}{The driver applied the brake suddenly to avoid the collision.}}
{{brand}}{/brænd/}{品牌；商标}{The company has built a strong brand identity.}}
{{breakthrough}}{/ˈbreɪkθruː/}{突破；重大进展}{The discovery was a major breakthrough in cancer research.}}
{{breed}}{/briːd/}{品种；繁殖}{This breed of dog is known for its intelligence.}}
{{breeze}}{/briːz/}{微风；轻松的事}{A gentle breeze blew through the open window.}}
{{brick}}{/brɪk/}{砖；砖块}{The old house was built of red brick.}}
{{bride}}{/braɪd/}{新娘}{The bride looked stunning in her white gown.}}
{{brink}}{/brɪŋk/}{边缘；濒临}{The company was on the brink of bankruptcy.}}
{{brittle}}{/ˈbrɪtl/}{易碎的；脆弱的}{The old documents were dry and brittle.}}
{{browse}}{/braʊz/}{浏览；吃草}{She browsed the internet for travel deals.}}
{{brutal}}{/ˈbruːtl/}{残忍的；严酷的}{The brutal winter storm caused widespread damage.}}
{{bubble}}{/ˈbʌbl/}{气泡；泡沫}{Bubbles floated up from the bottom of the fish tank.}}
{{bucket}}{/ˈbʌkɪt/}{水桶；大量}{The rain came down in buckets.}}
{{budget}}{/ˈbʌdʒɪt/}{预算；编预算}{We need to stick to the budget for this project.}}
{{bug}}{/bʌɡ/}{虫子；漏洞}{The software has a bug that causes it to crash.}}
{{bulk}}{/bʌlk/}{大量；体积}{The store sells items in bulk at discounted prices.}}
{{bullet}}{/ˈbʊlɪt/}{子弹；弹头}{The bullet missed the target by inches.}}
{{bulletin}}{/ˈbʊlɪtɪn/}{公告；简报}{The company issued a bulletin about the upcoming changes.}}
{{burden}}{/ˈbɜːdn/}{负担；责任}{The financial burden of student loans is significant.}}
{{bureau}}{/ˈbjʊərəʊ/}{局；办事处}{The statistics bureau published the latest population data.}}
